Error [E0203]: a value was passed with the move-capability marker `^` to a parameter that does not consume
  --> tests/ui/take_on_read_param.jet:7:12
    |
  7 |     greet(^msg)
    |            ^^^
 Why: only parameters declared with the move-capability marker `^` accept a moved value at the call site
 Fix: remove the move-capability marker `^`, or declare the parameter with that marker to take ownership
